  solvent.negative_ion        Cl-   (default)
  solvent.cutoff_nm           0.9   (set)
  constraints.type            HBonds   (set)
  constraints.rigid_water     True   (set)

Input interpretation
--------------------
  interpreted as              protein-ligand complex (.pdb), 1 ligand instance(s) mapped to parameter packages
  ligand L43                  chain 'B' resid '1' icode '' -> LOCAL-HKQHWWQCRDXFGC/param_c66a3e91a5dd
  coordinates                 the deposited pose; ligand hydrogens from each package
  small-molecule FF           not run: parameters loaded from the packages
  solvent treatment           explicit TIP3P, periodic
  protein FF                  amber14-all.xml
  water FF                    amber14/tip3p.xml

Preparation
-----------
  ligand       : L43 chain 'B' resid '1' icode '' -> LOCAL-HKQHWWQCRDXFGC/param_c66a3e91a5dd
  protonation  : pH 7.0, 2333 -> 2332 hydrogens; 1 ligand instance(s) kept as packaged
  protonation  : method openmm
  solvation    : 16076 waters, ions {'NA': 48, 'CL': 44}, box cube (559.0 nm^3)
  system       : PME, cutoff 0.9 nm, HBonds

